  description: Recent research has revealed that this intruder-defense enchanted
    puppet was almost an extension of the Divine Armor, and that it shared the Divine
    Armor's senses and consciousness. There is a very plausible possibility that
    the Divine Armor willed Barvars to engage in aggressive intruder-defense measures
    to address frequent otherworldly invasions. Had it completed its evolution, the
    Divine Armor might have transferred its essence into this puppet to take on a
    more combat-ready form.
